{
"k": "5452",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Ichabod yelled at me for another twenty minutes before sending me here to get you. So thanks for that."
},
{
"k": "5453",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Hello, Snow."
},
{
"k": "5454",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Had to follow a lead."
},
{
"k": "5455",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You don't need to apologize."
},
{
"k": "5456",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm sorry. I should've been there."
},
{
"k": "5457",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I understand. I just could've used the help explaining things to him."
},
{
"k": "5458",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You can handle him."
},
{
"k": "5459",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm sure you can handle a guy like Crane. He's all bark."
},
{
"k": "5460",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "First, you of all people shouldn't be using that phrase. Second, who said I couldn't handle him? It just would've been nice to not to have some backup. Sorry I asked. I won't next time."
},
{
"k": "5461",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You're not kicking this guys door in, okay? We don't even know if he did anything wrong, so bursting in there just to tell him his wife is dead might not be the best approach. Find another way in if he's not answering."
},
{
"k": "5462",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "See? Life closes a door, and it opens a window."
},
{
"k": "5463",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You know, support a friend in need. Something you clearly don't understand the concept of."
},
{
"k": "5464",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Aarrrgh. What the fuck?"
},
{
"k": "5465",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You know who I am?"
},
{
"k": "5466",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Yeah..."
},
{
"k": "5467",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Then you know why I'm here."
},
{
"k": "5468",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Why did you do it?!?"
},
{
"k": "5469",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "...thought it was a bad dream."
},
{
"k": "5470",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It wasn't! Tell me what's going on!"
},
{
"k": "5471",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I couldn't take it anymore. Alright?"
},
{
"k": "5472",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Aaargh... what are you doing here?"
},
{
"k": "5473",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm here about your wife..."
},
{
"k": "5474",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "No... no... what happened? Where is she?"
},
{
"k": "5475",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Why did you do it?!"
},
{
"k": "5476",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I just have a few questions."
},
{
"k": "5477",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm here about your wife."
},
{
"k": "5478",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Couldn't handle her being a whore?"
},
{
"k": "5479",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Couldn't handle her being a whore, huh?"
},
{
"k": "5480",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Of course not. It made me sick to my stomach just thinking about it."
},
{
"k": "5481",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So you wanted to show her how you felt."
},
{
"k": "5482",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "What? No."
},
{
"k": "5483",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I did it because I was ashamed."
},
{
"k": "5484",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Ashamed of her?"
},
{
"k": "5485",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "No. Ashamed of myself. I... I love her."
},
{
"k": "5486",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "That didn't keep you from killing her, did it?"
},
{
"k": "5487",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Wait, what? She..."
},
{
"k": "5488",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "No...no, no, no, no..."
},
{
"k": "5489",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I knew this would happen... I knew it..."
},
{
"k": "5490",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Is that reason enough to kill her?"
},
{
"k": "5491",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "And in your mind that was reason enough to kill her?"
},
{
"k": "5492",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Decided to teach her a lesson?"
},
{
"k": "5493",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So you decided to teach her a lesson."
},
{
"k": "5494",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Your wife is missing."
},
{
"k": "5495",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Someone heard a gunshot."
},
{
"k": "5496",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Someone heard a gunshot... we're following up on it."
},
{
"k": "5497",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You're following up on a gunshot from a week ago?"
},
{
"k": "5498",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We're a little backed up at the office."
},
{
"k": "5499",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm sorry, but your wife was murdered."
},
{
"k": "5500",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "What? Oh, no."
},
{
"k": "5501",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You killed her!"
},
{
"k": "5502",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Huh."
},
{
"k": "5503",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It's about Faith... isn't it?"
},
{
"k": "5504",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Did you kill your wife?"
},
{
"k": "5505",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You need to pull it together."
},
{
"k": "5506",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[play as if about to speak a longer thought] Lawrence, I uh..."
},
{
"k": "5507",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[play as if about to speak a longer thought.] Lawrence..."
},
{
"k": "5508",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Who is Georgie?"
},
{
"k": "5509",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Your gunshot?"
},
{
"k": "5510",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We'll be right in that closet over there."
},
{
"k": "5511",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We won't let anything happen to you. Okay?"
},
{
"k": "5512",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[hushed, to Lawrence] You can't move in the condition you're in, so just lie there and stay still. Once we've figured out what they're looking for, Bigby'll arrest them."
},
{
"k": "5513",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Okay?"
},
{
"k": "5514",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[alarmed] Bigby. He has a gun."
},
{
"k": "5515",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Don't be like that."
},
{
"k": "5516",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Please don't."
},
{
"k": "5517",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "That's not what I meant."
},
{
"k": "5518",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Yeah, I know. Sorry."
},
{
"k": "5519",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[grudgingly accepts help]Hm. Alright."
},
{
"k": "5520",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[mild] Hey!"
},
{
"k": "5521",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[bigger, after mild] Hey!"
},
{
"k": "5522",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Excuse me."
},
{
"k": "5523",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Sir?"
},
{
"k": "5524",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It's about your wife."
},
{
"k": "5525",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Are you Lawrence?"
},
{
"k": "5526",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Bigby! Look at this."
},
{
"k": "5527",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Don't just peep into someone's house. Check if he's home."
},
{
"k": "5528",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Do you see something?"
},
{
"k": "5529",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{worriedA}[alarmed] Can you hear me?!"
},
{
"k": "5530",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{fearA}Are you okay?"
},
{
"k": "5531",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{fearA}Hey! {angryA}Answer me!"
},
{
"k": "5532",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{worriedB}[to himself] Dammit."
},
{
"k": "5533",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Stay here!"
},
{
"k": "5534",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So. The shooter is standing here... and the bullet goes... there?"
},
{
"k": "5535",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Why shoot a guy who already killed himself?"
},
{
"k": "5536",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Dry."
},
{
"k": "5537",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Who walked away from the bed. And why?"
},
{
"k": "5538",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "But who the hell bled out here?"
},
{
"k": "5539",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Sharp. And [sniffs]blood on the blade."
},
{
"k": "5540",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "They're way too nice for this shit hole."
},
{
"k": "5541",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Wedding gift."
},
{
"k": "5542",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Damn."
},
{
"k": "5543",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Like that one."
},
{
"k": "5544",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[amazed, not angry]Son of a ..."
},
{
"k": "5545",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Huh. So is this where he killed her? Or himself?"
},
{
"k": "5546",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "More dried blood. Now at least I know it's his."
},
{
"k": "5547",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "And then moved here?"
},
{
"k": "5548",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Was he shot here?"
},
{
"k": "5549",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The wrists are making me think suicide."
},
{
"k": "5550",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Thinking it happened there."
},
{
"k": "5551",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "What exactly?"
},
{
"k": "5552",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "There was a fight. Someone got stabbed right there."
},
{
"k": "5553",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I think he did this to himself. The slashed wrists, the knife."
},
{
"k": "5554",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The shooter was bleeding. Stood here."
},
{
"k": "5555",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The way his wrists are slashed, and the knife... makes me think he did it to himself."
},
{
"k": "5556",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "It's... just... I think you're right..."
},
{
"k": "5557",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "There's no blood here, though. It should be everywhere."
},
{
"k": "5558",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Or where he killed Faith... or someone else..."
},
{
"k": "5559",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Oh no. Is that where he was murdered?"
},
{
"k": "5560",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Blood spilled over the edge here."
},
{
"k": "5561",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[about the blood]Strange. Hard edge to this pool. Like something was here, and got moved."
},
{
"k": "5562",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Poor guy. Well, now we know where the blood came from."
},
{
"k": "5563",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Slit his wrists. Poor bastard."
},
{
"k": "5564",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You tried once over there, with the knife. It didn't work."
},
{
"k": "5565",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I'm sorry to say, it looks like I was right."
},
{
"k": "5566",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[ruling that out as an option]Nope..."
},
{
"k": "5567",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Well, can you narrow it down?"
},
{
"k": "5568",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "What's wrong?"
},
{
"k": "5569",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[through clenched teeth, still lighting the smoke]Everything!"
},
{
"k": "5570",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The angle of the shot is all wrong. It's too low. If there was a shooter, where did he shoot from?"
},
{
"k": "5571",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "The blood. He slit his wrists, and he's sitting in the chair. So what the hell is up with all the blood over here?"
},
{
"k": "5572",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Maybe he tried, and it didn't work.."
},
{
"k": "5573",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Maybe there was no shooter... [trails off]"
},
{
"k": "5574",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "We just... we don't usually kill ourselves. Immortals..."
},
{
"k": "5575",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "And when it happens, it takes a lot more than this. I don't understand it."
},
{
"k": "5576",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You're gonna have to talk to me sometime."
},
{
"k": "5577",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So what happened to you?"
},
{
"k": "5578",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Hmm... makes sense, the wrists and then he finished the job."
},
{
"k": "5579",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[sad, realizing the death wasn't a nice one]It must have taken hours."
},
{
"k": "5580",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "So, after he cut himself, someone shot him?\nWhile kneeling?"
},
{
"k": "5581",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I guess I don't see it. But you're the Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "5582",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Line it up like... like he shot himself."
},
{
"k": "5583",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Do me a favor?"
},
{
"k": "5584",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I had a feeling."
},
{
"k": "5585",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I see now."
},
{
"k": "5586",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "BIGBY"
},
{
"k": "5587",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[calling to Bigby]Did you find it yet?"
},
{
"k": "5588",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Dusty. No one's read these in awhile."
},
{
"k": "5589",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Second-hand paperbacks. Old encyclopedias."
},
{
"k": "5590",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Looks like Faith took all her stuff out."
},
{
"k": "5591",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Guess this is where he tried the first time."
},
{
"k": "5592",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Jump Out"
},
{
"k": "5593",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Yell In"
},
{
"k": "5594",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Gun"
},
{
"k": "5595",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Bullet Hole"
},
{
"k": "5596",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Shell Casing"
},
{
"k": "5597",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Knives"
},
{
"k": "5598",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Wrist"
},
{
"k": "5599",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Book Case"
},
{
"k": "5600",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Note"
},
{
"k": "5601",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingB}Hey!"
},
{
"k": "5602",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{angryA}Hey!"
},
{
"k": "5603",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "english"
},
{
"k": "5604",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{doubtfulA}Excuse me."
},
{
"k": "5605",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingB}Sir?"
},
{
"k": "5606",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{doubtfulA}Are you Lawrence?"
},
{
"k": "5607",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{worriedA}It's about your wife, Faith."
},
{
"k": "5608",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{normalA}You got it open. Great. {thinkingC}Let's get in there."
},
{
"k": "5609",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You {surprisedA}need a boost?"
},
{
"k": "5610",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Is that a joke about my height?"
},
{
"k": "5611",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "No. I'm trying to be helpful."
},
{
"k": "5612",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "You know, support a friend in need. Something you clearly don't understand concept of."
},
{
"k": "5613",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{happyB}Well, help me up when {normalA}you get in there."
},
{
"k": "5614",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingA}I'll just open the door for you."
},
{
"k": "5615",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{sarcasticA}I don't need to be coddled, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "5616",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingC}Come on. Help me up."
},
{
"k": "5617",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{fearA}[alarmed] Bigby. {flusteredA}He has a gun."
},
{
"k": "5618",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Good. I {thinkingB}have a few questions."
},
{
"k": "5619",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{sadA}I should know his face. There {worriedA}are so few of us... I {flusteredB}should know his face."
},
{
"k": "5620",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "What-what are you doing here?"
},
{
"k": "5621",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{worriedA}Calm down..."
},
{
"k": "5622",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{doubtfulA}You know who I am?"
},
{
"k": "5623",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[Give Him The Letter]"
},
{
"k": "5624",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I found this. It's addressed to you."
},
{
"k": "5625",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Lawrence. Have you heard from... [she thinks the better of it]."
},
{
"k": "5626",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "[more confused than interrogating]What?"
},
{
"k": "5627",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "When was the last time you saw your wife?"
},
{
"k": "5628",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{thinkingB}When was the last time you {angryA}saw your wife, Lawrence?"
},
{
"k": "5629",
"who": "LAWRENCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I… I don't know… a few weeks ago. She… came by to get some things… that's what she said… but I think it was so she could leave some money. I didn't find it 'til later. We've been… separated for some time now."
},
{
"k": "5630",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Why did you do it?"
},
{
"k": "5631",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I want to know something, Lawrence. Why did you do it?"
},
{
"k": "5632",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "{worriedA}Why? Wh--What's this about?"
},
{
"k": "5633",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Shit... I was here. Dead. Least I thought I'd be dead. Fuck has it really been a week?"
},
{
"k": "5634",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Tuesday."
},
{
"k": "5635",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "I don't know. What's today?"
},
{
"k": "5636",
"who": "CAKEPRINCE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
"en": "Yeah. I guess so."
},
{
"k": "5637",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_faithapartment",
